    <dashboard _.fcp.AccessibleZoneTabOrder.true...enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='ScoreCard Calculation'>
      <repository-location id='ScoreCardCalculation' path='/t/GlobalStandardReporting/workbooks/AssortmentQualityScoreCard_V4_Simulation' revision='' site='GlobalStandardReporting' />
      <style />
      <size maxheight='1350' maxwidth='1000' minheight='1350' minwidth='1000' sizing-mode='fixed' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='6' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='3849' id='5' type-v2='text' w='98400' x='800' y='17229'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#e15759' fontsize='18'>How is the Score calculated?</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='7531' id='7' type-v2='text' w='98400' x='800' y='21078'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>In order to obtain the final score, the eight KPIs shown below are taken into account. Depending on the performance of each month, each KPI receives an specific amount of points (0 to 10) and then those points are multiplied by the weight of each KPI and added altogether to have the final score between 0 and 100. Please refer to the image below to understand better the weight and points per each KPI  </run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='16636' id='45' is-centered='0' is-scaled='1' param='Image/DH-Logo_Tableau.PNG' type-v2='bitmap' w='14400' x='800' y='593'>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='16636' id='46' type-v2='text' w='84000' x='15200' y='593'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontcolor='#e15759' fontsize='32'>Assortment Quality ScoreCard</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#606b76' fontsize='12'>QUICK-COMMERCE</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#c70b5d' fontsize='13'>D-Marts</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='4519' id='47' type-v2='text' w='98400' x='800' y='48192'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#e15759' fontsize='18'>Metrics: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#ea565f' fontsize='14' italic='true'>Definitions &amp; Calculations</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='46696' id='48' type-v2='text' w='98400' x='800' y='52711'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11' italic='true' underline='true'>Imput Metrics</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11' italic='true'>*KEEP IN MIND: Input metrics assess the performance of each warehouse. However, when looking at a country, regional, or global level, they are calculated by taking the weighted average of the warehouse input metric and  the GPV.  Warehouses are considered in this report  if (1) iwarehouse maturity is greater than 90 days and (2) are not closed/to close warehouses.  </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Listed SKUs</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>: Number of listed SKUs at the last day of the month (only mature warehouses are considered)</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Efficiency</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'><![CDATA[: 1 - (Number of listed SKUs older than 90 days with average unit sold < 1 per warehouse-week / Number of listed SKUs older than 90 days)]]></run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Avg. Coverage L3 Categories</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>: The average number of  listed Level 3 Categories / total number Level 3 Categories per country</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>UltraFresh GPV contribution:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'> GPV contribution (total value paid including VAT) by UltraFresh categories - Produce, Ready to Consume and Meat/Seafood</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Newness:  </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'><![CDATA[Number of SKUs < 30 days old / Number of listed SKUs]]></run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Spoilage %:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'> Spoilage (WAC) / Retail Revenue (net of delivery / discounts)</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>DOH </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>(</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Days on Hand without DCs):</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'> book value / COGS for given period</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11' italic='true' underline='true'>Perception Metrics</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Content Score: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Average of aggregated completeness and quality metrics score (For WHs the country&apos;s Content Score is shown)</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Instock %: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Percentage Availability (Hours Available / Potential Hours)</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Dist. Listed SKU: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Total distinct SKUs in a country</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Avg. Listed SKUs:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>  Average Listed SKUs for the whole month</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>GPV Share: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Share of GPV based on total whs/countries/regions displayed (Be aware that calculation is along table, meaning that if you manually select some countries, the GPV share will be recalculated based only on those selected) </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11' italic='true' underline='true'>Output Metrics</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>ABV:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'> Average Basket Value:  Total GPV / Number of orders</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>ABS:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'> Average Basket Size:  Total Items Sold / Number of orders</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>ODS</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>: Orders per Day per Store</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Frequency</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>: Number of Orders / Number of Unique Customers</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>CVR (Dmart homepage to Transaction)</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>: Conversion rate i.e total number of sessions with transactions/total number of sessions (For WHs the country&apos;s CVR is shown)</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='19583' id='503' is-centered='0' is-scaled='1' param='Image/AQS_V3_FV_Instr.png' type-v2='bitmap' w='98400' x='800' y='28609'>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <devicelayouts>
        <devicelayout auto-generated='true' name='Phone'>
          <size maxheight='850' minheight='850' sizing-mode='vscroll' />
          <zones>
            <zone h='100000' id='1113' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
              <zone h='98814' id='1112' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98400' x='800' y='593'>
                <zone fixed-size='217' h='16636' id='45' is-centered='0' is-fixed='true' is-scaled='1' param='Image/DH-Logo_Tableau.PNG' type-v2='bitmap' w='14400' x='800' y='593'>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='16636' id='46' type-v2='text' w='84000' x='15200' y='593'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontcolor='#e15759' fontsize='32'>Assortment Quality ScoreCard</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#606b76' fontsize='12'>QUICK-COMMERCE</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#c70b5d' fontsize='13'>D-Marts</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='3849' id='5' type-v2='text' w='98400' x='800' y='17229'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#e15759' fontsize='18'>How is the Score calculated?</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='7531' id='7' type-v2='text' w='98400' x='800' y='21078'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>In order to obtain the final score, the eight KPIs shown below are taken into account. Depending on the performance of each month, each KPI receives an specific amount of points (0 to 10) and then those points are multiplied by the weight of each KPI and added altogether to have the final score between 0 and 100. Please refer to the image below to understand better the weight and points per each KPI  </run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='257' h='19583' id='503' is-centered='0' is-fixed='true' is-scaled='1' param='Image/AQS_V3_FV_Instr.png' type-v2='bitmap' w='98400' x='800' y='28609'>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='4519' id='47' type-v2='text' w='98400' x='800' y='48192'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#e15759' fontsize='18'>Metrics: </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ea565f' fontsize='14' italic='true'>Definitions &amp; Calculations</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='46696' id='48' type-v2='text' w='98400' x='800' y='52711'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11' italic='true' underline='true'>Imput Metrics</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11' italic='true'>*KEEP IN MIND: Input metrics assess the performance of each warehouse. However, when looking at a country, regional, or global level, they are calculated by taking the weighted average of the warehouse input metric and  the GPV.  Warehouses are considered in this report  if (1) iwarehouse maturity is greater than 90 days and (2) are not closed/to close warehouses.  </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Listed SKUs</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>: Number of listed SKUs at the last day of the month (only mature warehouses are considered)</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Efficiency</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'><![CDATA[: 1 - (Number of listed SKUs older than 90 days with average unit sold < 1 per warehouse-week / Number of listed SKUs older than 90 days)]]></run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Avg. Coverage L3 Categories</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>: The average number of  listed Level 3 Categories / total number Level 3 Categories per country</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>UltraFresh GPV contribution:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'> GPV contribution (total value paid including VAT) by UltraFresh categories - Produce, Ready to Consume and Meat/Seafood</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Newness:  </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'><![CDATA[Number of SKUs < 30 days old / Number of listed SKUs]]></run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Spoilage %:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'> Spoilage (WAC) / Retail Revenue (net of delivery / discounts)</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>DOH </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>(</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Days on Hand without DCs):</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'> book value / COGS for given period</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11' italic='true' underline='true'>Perception Metrics</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Content Score: </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Average of aggregated completeness and quality metrics score (For WHs the country&apos;s Content Score is shown)</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Instock %: </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Percentage Availability (Hours Available / Potential Hours)</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Dist. Listed SKU: </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Total distinct SKUs in a country</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Avg. Listed SKUs:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>  Average Listed SKUs for the whole month</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>GPV Share: </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Share of GPV based on total whs/countries/regions displayed (Be aware that calculation is along table, meaning that if you manually select some countries, the GPV share will be recalculated based only on those selected) </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11' italic='true' underline='true'>Output Metrics</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>ABV:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'> Average Basket Value:  Total GPV / Number of orders</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>ABS:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'> Average Basket Size:  Total Items Sold / Number of orders</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>ODS</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>: Orders per Day per Store</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Frequency</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>: Number of Orders / Number of Unique Customers</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>CVR (Dmart homepage to Transaction)</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>: Conversion rate i.e total number of sessions with transactions/total number of sessions (For WHs the country&apos;s CVR is shown)</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
